WEBVTT

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:44.250
Late years in Previous Century

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:27.210
Gonglong!

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:32.010
Stop drawing already.
The teacher's gonna get mad.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:35.470
Aw, c'mon...

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:38.640
That's lame!

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:46.150
Hey! That's my...

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.490
Stop it...

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:52.610
You bastard...

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:54.950
Gonna do somethin' about it?

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:56.120
Do somethin' about it!

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.160
Cut it out!

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.290
I said, cut it out!

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:05.090
Ooo, Meihua.
You in Iove with Gonglong?

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:08.340
You love him! You love him!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:14.680
Are you kidding? Not in 100 years!

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:28.070
Let's go back.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:29.030
We'll get in trouble.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.030
Look at that hole...

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:32.700
l wonder what fell.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:35.030
Watch out, Gonglong.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:41.040
Where's it go?

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:45.500
What's this?

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.340
Lemme see, Gonglong.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.130
That looks dangerous.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:42.430
Hey...

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:43.640
What!?

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:44.350
Whoa!

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:45.770
How the heck?

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:48.610
No, Gonglong!

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.610
Mmmm! Yummy!

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:56.200
The System has been activated.

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:57.910
Activated?

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.620
There's actually a human who
can activate the System!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:07.880
If the System and that human are
captured by the AI, we're doomed...

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:11.210
We have to hurry!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:22.970
Lemme see!

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.640
Move it!

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.360
Don't Meihua.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.150
We better call the teacher.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:38.570
Mmmm! Yummy...

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:40.200
Give it here.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:43.740
No! That's mine!

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:45.330
Wow, it's glowing.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:54.590
Give it back!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.190
lt's dangerous.
Everyone gather 'round!

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:39.610
System Activator Confirmed.

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:44.820
It's a human child.
Estimated age 5 - 6 years.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:49.040
Can this be... the legendary child?

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:52.830
Interpretation System - Activated

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:57.920
My name is Crane Shumer of the
Time Space Patrol.

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.880
I strongly request your assistance.

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:04.340
No, Gonglong. The teacher said
don't talk to strangers.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:05.140
What?

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:12.560
This is a prototype of a System that
turns human thoughts into reality.

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:18.020
You are the first to succeed in breaking
the barrier and activating the System.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:22.400
Our only hope of survival
depends on this System...

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:24.910
And you!

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:31.040
Can't you understand me?

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:38.750
What is this chaos?

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:40.590
This way!

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:52.720
I'm counting on you, Sai.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.850
- Hey, thief!
- Never mind. Hang on!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:16.460
Behind you!

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:35.060
We're floating.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.520
They want to capture you.
Close your ears!

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:43.860
We did it!

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:12.850
Watch your head!

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:22.650
Way to go, Meihua!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.120
Are you alright?

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.830
Stay still!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.670
Idiot!

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:07.800
Sai!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.220
Sai!

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:27.770
How could these idiots be our saviors?

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.170
Help!

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:53.050
Transforming!

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:01.810
Go! Rider! Hiiiiyah!

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.710
Transforming!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.640
I'm Rider!

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:49.150
Yah! Go! Rider! Hah!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:07.750
What?

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:28.850
What is this?

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:31.020
Gonglong! Behind you!

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.700
Unbelievable...

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.870
Way to go, Gonglong!

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.540
No way...

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:05.100
I'm going to save the earth!

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:06.470
Wait! That's...

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:13.150
Gonglong-!

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.440
Thunderbeam!

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:19.400
Yah!

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.450
Lightening rod!

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:41.090
One more time...

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:54.810
Are you alright?

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:58.440
My... my suit.

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:03.910
Quick! Draw the strongest weapon
you can think of!

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:10.580
But the lightening rod is the
strongest weapon there is and...

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:12.040
Then a missile!

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:14.750
A... missile?

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:20.800
Hurry!

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:26.300
You're taking too long!

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.810
Hey! My picture!

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:33.390
Yes!

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:35.480
This is good!

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:22.980
Where'd you come from?

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:25.530
From a star out there.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:30.030
But l don't see any stars out there.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:31.950
Not yet.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:35.290
It may be a little hard to grasp,

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.790
but the earth 300 years from now
is out there.

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:40.040
300 years?

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:44.340
The earth and sun are
passing through the galaxy

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:47.720
heading towards Lyra.

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:53.260
That's why 300 years from now,
our earth will be out there.

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:56.640
And 300 years later,

00:21:56.640 --> 00:22:02.480
over reliance on biotechnology results
in mankind's inability to procreate.

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:09.740
There are no more children being born.

00:22:10.070 --> 00:22:11.240
What?

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:16.200
We came back to collect
the imagination of you "children."

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:17.790
That was our mission.

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:30.590
Let's go!

00:22:50.740 --> 00:22:52.030
It's beautiful!

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:54.780
Yahoo!

00:22:59.330 --> 00:23:00.500
Thanks, buddy!

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:08.630
Are we all ready to roll?

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:11.050
Gonglong, I'm scared.

00:23:11.340 --> 00:23:12.840
Don't worry!

00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:17.060
All systems, go!

00:24:55.570 --> 00:25:01.740
SHANGHAI DRAGON
THE END

00:25:42.120 --> 00:25:43.620
Are you still asleep?

00:25:43.620 --> 00:25:46.250
You'll be late for school.

00:25:50.340 --> 00:25:51.130
Cut it out.

00:25:51.130 --> 00:25:55.010
Stop playing dead.
Unfuk is already up.

00:25:55.470 --> 00:25:57.380
Oops...

00:25:57.590 --> 00:25:59.970
There, good as new.

00:26:01.560 --> 00:26:04.430
Eat up! Your favorite breakfast.

00:26:04.980 --> 00:26:07.600
We got some really nice worms today.

00:26:07.600 --> 00:26:11.360
Wow! Great. But l hate worms.

00:26:12.940 --> 00:26:16.990
Hurry up or you'll miss the school bus.
Still haven't made any friends?

00:26:16.990 --> 00:26:21.240
l fit in with this world perfectly.
My body stinks like everybody.

00:26:21.240 --> 00:26:23.160
OK, OK. I'm going.

00:26:39.180 --> 00:26:41.550
The sky looks strange.

00:27:31.810 --> 00:27:33.730
You stink.

00:27:33.730 --> 00:27:34.610
Can l touch you?

00:27:36.860 --> 00:27:38.530
Can l lick you?

00:27:39.740 --> 00:27:40.700
What's that?

00:27:40.700 --> 00:27:43.780
You don't know anything!
It's an Uzu Uzu.

00:27:43.990 --> 00:27:45.240
Wow! An Uzu Uzu!

00:27:45.240 --> 00:27:46.160
Cool!

00:27:46.160 --> 00:27:47.290
It's super dangerous.

00:27:47.450 --> 00:27:50.000
Only appears once a year.

00:27:51.080 --> 00:27:52.580
Can I eat you?

00:27:52.750 --> 00:27:54.380
Help!!!

00:27:54.540 --> 00:27:55.580
Not again.

00:27:55.590 --> 00:27:57.170
He's digging in.

00:27:58.130 --> 00:28:01.550
Zombies are best when
made 50 days post mortem.

00:28:01.550 --> 00:28:05.590
The embalming compound
must be rubbed in thoroughly...

00:28:08.310 --> 00:28:10.640
l smell something alive.

00:28:15.560 --> 00:28:19.280
You may have noticed there is
an Uzu Uzu out today.

00:28:19.280 --> 00:28:21.940
You have to be careful.

00:28:21.950 --> 00:28:24.950
Hey! Where'd he go?

00:28:29.490 --> 00:28:31.950
So you guys are heroes?

00:28:33.290 --> 00:28:34.420
Yep, yep.

00:28:34.420 --> 00:28:36.750
Ashe fights off enemies with fire?

00:28:39.130 --> 00:28:40.460
Wow.

00:28:40.460 --> 00:28:43.420
Blåse can manipulate water?

00:28:43.430 --> 00:28:44.470
Yep.

00:28:45.140 --> 00:28:47.800
Cool. You guys rock.

00:28:47.970 --> 00:28:51.020
What can you do, Påse?

00:28:51.520 --> 00:28:53.520
Take this off...

00:28:53.520 --> 00:28:55.850
And I'm super-Zombie!

00:28:55.850 --> 00:28:56.650
Wow, Påse!

00:28:56.650 --> 00:28:58.060
Hurry up. How'd he get in?

00:28:58.070 --> 00:28:59.820
Who are they?

00:29:01.530 --> 00:29:04.950
You mean us?
Blåse and... I'm Ashe.

00:29:04.950 --> 00:29:06.360
You got a problem?

00:29:06.870 --> 00:29:10.790
You're not what l expected,
that's all.

00:29:11.290 --> 00:29:13.870
What do you mean?

00:29:14.040 --> 00:29:19.420
We were just out
conquering evil after school.

00:29:21.710 --> 00:29:24.760
Gross! He squirted water on me.

00:29:24.760 --> 00:29:26.840
Get lost, you fire breathing loser!

00:29:27.680 --> 00:29:30.350
And that's how we conquered evil.

00:29:31.520 --> 00:29:33.350
OK?

00:29:33.350 --> 00:29:38.810
OK. l wanted to ask you heroes a favor.

00:29:39.190 --> 00:29:40.400
A favor?

00:29:40.570 --> 00:29:43.230
Yeah. lt's this...

00:29:44.860 --> 00:29:48.660
Whoa! It's alive!
A living frog!

00:29:49.740 --> 00:29:52.370
My tummy.
I'm gonna blow...

00:29:54.660 --> 00:29:58.000
A live frog? Are you nuts?

00:29:58.000 --> 00:30:00.130
I thought l was gonna die!

00:30:00.130 --> 00:30:03.170
I want to return him to his home.

00:30:03.380 --> 00:30:05.630
What? That's impossible.

00:30:05.630 --> 00:30:09.430
But Påse said you two could do it.

00:30:09.720 --> 00:30:13.640
No way.
We'll be busted by the Zombie police.

00:30:13.640 --> 00:30:15.310
Although I've never seen one.

00:30:18.770 --> 00:30:20.810
lt's not impossible.

00:30:21.940 --> 00:30:23.730
In the Uzu Uzu hole?

00:30:26.280 --> 00:30:32.490
Blåse says the Uzu Uzu
could take it back.

00:30:35.120 --> 00:30:36.330
Really?

00:30:56.020 --> 00:30:58.480
Oh, it's just a kid.

00:31:08.450 --> 00:31:10.280
Maybe not.

00:31:16.580 --> 00:31:18.660
Wait a minute...

00:31:24.090 --> 00:31:27.170
It's the Zombie police!

00:31:27.340 --> 00:31:29.010
Run!

00:31:35.260 --> 00:31:37.810
We're in trouble now!
Throw that thing out!

00:31:38.020 --> 00:31:39.770
No.

00:31:39.770 --> 00:31:40.980
Whose side are you on?

00:31:40.980 --> 00:31:42.690
No. lt's alive.

00:31:42.900 --> 00:31:45.310
Hurry Påse! They're catching up!

00:31:45.480 --> 00:31:48.030
l can't make sharp turns. Oh well.

00:31:54.070 --> 00:31:56.870
They're still after us!

00:31:57.040 --> 00:31:58.790
Man... they're relentless.

00:32:00.330 --> 00:32:02.210
Whoa!!!

00:32:02.370 --> 00:32:03.830
Thanks Blåse.

00:32:15.260 --> 00:32:19.810
This is where the secret weapon
Black Maria is hidden.

00:32:21.430 --> 00:32:23.850
Wow. Pretty impressive.

00:32:24.560 --> 00:32:28.230
We're here. l hate running.

00:32:35.990 --> 00:32:38.950
What secret weapon?
It doesn't even have an engine.

00:32:39.410 --> 00:32:41.700
Don't worry. lt's all downhill.

00:32:41.870 --> 00:32:44.710
The Uzu Uzu's lighting up. Hurry!

00:33:01.060 --> 00:33:02.100
They're on us!

00:33:02.270 --> 00:33:03.680
They're all over!

00:33:04.850 --> 00:33:06.310
Behind you, Påse!

00:33:13.450 --> 00:33:15.320
We're crossing the bridge.

00:33:15.820 --> 00:33:18.820
Darn! The bridge is rising.
Move, Påse!

00:33:18.830 --> 00:33:20.740
l can't see a thing!

00:33:20.740 --> 00:33:23.120
But I can't stop!

00:33:24.370 --> 00:33:27.120
It's not just the bridge. Listen!

00:33:27.290 --> 00:33:28.290
lt's Valbåt!

00:33:33.340 --> 00:33:35.590
Shoot. We're slowing down.

00:33:35.930 --> 00:33:37.890
We're trapped!

00:33:37.890 --> 00:33:42.680
We can do it! Blåse!
Give Påse lots of water.

00:33:43.560 --> 00:33:44.480
Hurry!

00:33:44.480 --> 00:33:46.480
What are you doing?

00:33:47.020 --> 00:33:47.940
I'm so bloated!

00:33:48.150 --> 00:33:49.610
I'm gonna blow!

00:33:50.360 --> 00:33:52.610
Stop!
I'm right "behind" you...

00:33:56.950 --> 00:33:58.780
We need you right there!

00:33:58.780 --> 00:34:01.870
Push down on Påse's stomach!

00:34:02.080 --> 00:34:04.450
One, two,

00:34:06.080 --> 00:34:07.160
Three!

00:34:07.170 --> 00:34:09.630
I'm gonna blow!

00:34:38.530 --> 00:34:40.910
We can't get any closer.

00:34:45.700 --> 00:34:50.040
Rått, give me your shoelaces.

00:34:50.630 --> 00:34:51.880
OK.

00:34:55.760 --> 00:34:56.800
There!

00:34:56.800 --> 00:34:59.220
You're a genius.

00:35:05.520 --> 00:35:07.140
Fly!

00:36:31.310 --> 00:36:34.770
DOORBELL

00:37:05.220 --> 00:37:08.970
You'll hurt yourself
walking backwards like that.

00:38:03.070 --> 00:38:04.440
I'm home.

00:38:34.680 --> 00:38:37.100
Did the front door just open?

00:38:37.600 --> 00:38:39.100
But no one's there.

00:38:49.240 --> 00:38:51.280
Can l come over?

00:38:51.820 --> 00:38:54.790
Sure, is something wrong?

00:38:55.500 --> 00:38:58.870
No... same old thing.

00:38:59.170 --> 00:39:03.790
"Same old thing"?
I don't get it.

00:39:04.130 --> 00:39:06.880
You don't have to get it.

00:40:25.790 --> 00:40:27.000
Shit!

00:42:24.290 --> 00:42:26.830
Hey... sorry for barging in.

00:42:32.250 --> 00:42:33.880
Not again...

00:42:34.340 --> 00:42:37.170
What? No one's there...

00:42:40.550 --> 00:42:43.430
But the doorbell rang, right?

00:42:45.180 --> 00:42:49.350
Of course the guy has to apologize.

00:42:49.350 --> 00:42:52.270
Even if she's clearly at fault?

00:42:52.730 --> 00:42:58.450
She probably knows she's wrong.

00:42:58.650 --> 00:43:03.620
But it's easier if the guy
apologizes first.

00:43:03.620 --> 00:43:07.700
How can I do that
knowing that I'm right?

00:43:09.000 --> 00:43:12.380
Of course you have to apologize.

00:43:12.790 --> 00:43:15.300
Even if he's clearly at fault?

00:43:15.460 --> 00:43:20.090
He probably knows he's wrong.

00:43:20.090 --> 00:43:23.220
But it's easier...

00:43:23.430 --> 00:43:26.260
if the girl apologizes first.

00:43:26.270 --> 00:43:28.020
You've got to be kidding.

00:43:28.020 --> 00:43:30.100
You sure are stubborn.

00:43:30.270 --> 00:43:31.730
I'm not stubborn.

00:43:31.730 --> 00:43:32.520
Pig-headed, then?

00:43:36.230 --> 00:43:38.360
Mai Yasuno

00:43:53.080 --> 00:43:55.210
Hello.

00:43:56.300 --> 00:43:59.630
Of course she has to apologize.

00:44:00.220 --> 00:44:02.970
Even if Tanaka's clearly at fault?

00:44:02.970 --> 00:44:09.430
He probably knows he's wrong.

00:44:09.430 --> 00:44:15.770
The person you have called
cannot be reached.

00:44:16.070 --> 00:44:18.480
Hello? Hello?

00:44:18.480 --> 00:44:19.530
Oh.

00:44:44.840 --> 00:44:48.350
It's Yu. l just called.

00:44:48.350 --> 00:44:50.970
Oh, yeah. Where are you?

00:44:50.980 --> 00:44:53.230
Downstairs. At your front door.

00:44:54.190 --> 00:44:57.610
OK. Wait a second.
I'm coming right down.

00:44:58.020 --> 00:45:00.110
Um, by any chance, is...

00:45:00.110 --> 00:45:00.780
What?

00:45:05.910 --> 00:45:07.240
Hey, you.

00:45:08.160 --> 00:45:09.490
I need to use that.

00:45:10.120 --> 00:45:12.370
Oh. Excuse me.

00:45:18.250 --> 00:45:19.210
Yes?

00:45:19.750 --> 00:45:21.420
lt's me.

00:45:21.760 --> 00:45:24.340
Oh, grandma.
You here already?

00:45:24.510 --> 00:45:28.010
That was fast. One minute.

00:45:43.990 --> 00:45:48.240
Hello? Hello? What's wrong?
By any chance, what?

00:45:48.450 --> 00:45:49.820
Never mind.

00:45:50.030 --> 00:45:51.490
I'm coming down.

00:45:51.700 --> 00:45:53.290
Uh, OK.

00:47:31.930 --> 00:47:35.810
What's wrong?
Why'd you throw your bag?

00:47:35.970 --> 00:47:37.720
Well... l...

00:47:38.140 --> 00:47:40.230
It's strange...

00:47:40.440 --> 00:47:44.690
I thought I saw two of you.

00:47:45.320 --> 00:47:48.320
That was the old me.

00:47:48.320 --> 00:47:49.490
What do you mean?

00:47:50.360 --> 00:47:52.530
Never mind. I'm glad...

00:47:53.160 --> 00:47:55.450
About what?

00:47:56.290 --> 00:47:58.450
That you're seeing me.

00:47:58.660 --> 00:48:01.290
What do you mean?

00:48:01.870 --> 00:48:04.460
That l was here first this time.

00:48:05.090 --> 00:48:09.460
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:48:15.300 --> 00:48:19.640
Yeah... lt's kind of pretty, isn't it?

00:48:26.860 --> 00:48:30.780
But really, I saw two of you
a minute ago!

00:48:31.780 --> 00:48:32.820
l knew it.

00:48:32.990 --> 00:48:35.320
What do you mean by that?

00:48:35.320 --> 00:48:38.790
Do you have a twin?
ls that it?

00:48:39.500 --> 00:48:42.210
You could even be a triplet...

00:48:43.580 --> 00:48:46.580
Aren't you cold?

00:48:46.590 --> 00:48:48.670
I don't get it either.

00:48:49.420 --> 00:48:53.050
There are a bunch of me,
and if i don't watch out...

00:48:53.630 --> 00:48:55.890
another me will take over.

00:48:57.100 --> 00:48:59.220
i know I'm not making sense.

00:48:59.930 --> 00:49:01.890
it's hard to explain.

00:49:02.640 --> 00:49:05.850
But I'm awfully glad to see you.

00:49:24.540 --> 00:49:26.000
A void.

00:49:28.500 --> 00:49:30.380
That which is not essential.

00:49:30.380 --> 00:49:34.170
Extremely wrong and
extremely unhealthy.

00:49:34.970 --> 00:49:40.310
Our intentions entrap our souls
in another's.

00:49:42.100 --> 00:49:46.310
It is unnatural.
We each have our own place.

00:49:56.820 --> 00:50:01.490
They don't know l am judging them
by my own watch.

00:50:01.490 --> 00:50:04.870
A God that is emotional, not rational.

00:50:05.080 --> 00:50:06.870
An embodiment.

00:50:08.330 --> 00:50:09.830
External circumstances.

00:50:11.090 --> 00:50:13.460
A fake window creates balance.

00:50:14.420 --> 00:50:16.420
Absence and corruption.

00:50:16.800 --> 00:50:17.680
Probability...

00:50:20.970 --> 00:50:22.560
Habits.

00:50:22.810 --> 00:50:25.270
Codes. Words.

00:50:25.430 --> 00:50:27.020
Prayer.

00:50:27.020 --> 00:50:29.600
Why did God create prayer?

00:50:29.860 --> 00:50:33.110
To impart dignity to cause and effect...

00:50:33.110 --> 00:50:37.360
To allow us to implore...
to teach us...

00:50:42.530 --> 00:50:48.870
Our souls see numbers,
space, activity.

00:50:48.870 --> 00:50:50.420
We think of nothing else.

00:50:50.580 --> 00:50:54.380
Who would doubt that

00:50:54.380 --> 00:50:56.960
we think of nothing else?

00:50:57.420 --> 00:51:01.220
"But we have no light."

00:51:03.350 --> 00:51:08.270
Words change the meaning of things,
but the meaning remains the same.

00:51:08.940 --> 00:51:10.140
Eternity.

00:51:10.150 --> 00:51:11.650
Circle of life.

00:51:11.650 --> 00:51:16.940
Literally, it's a falsehood, therefore
spiritually, a truth.

00:51:22.320 --> 00:51:24.950
A kind of dubious obscurity.

00:51:25.160 --> 00:51:29.960
No price is too high for immortality.

00:51:30.120 --> 00:51:33.630
If it weren't dubious,
Man would not know his own corruption.

00:51:33.790 --> 00:51:38.380
If there was no light,
Man would not seek salvation.

00:51:40.010 --> 00:51:41.340
Protector of God's Grace.

00:51:44.560 --> 00:51:46.180
Salvation...

00:51:46.180 --> 00:51:48.470
When miracles betray hope...

00:51:48.480 --> 00:51:50.350
When miracles reward hope...

00:51:50.350 --> 00:51:53.810
Chance changes our minds,
Chance deprives our minds.

00:51:54.520 --> 00:51:58.570
We have no ability to acquire
our thoughts.

00:51:58.990 --> 00:52:03.410
It is not what motivates us.

00:52:04.280 --> 00:52:08.870
It is not desirable to be an
exception to the rule.

00:52:08.870 --> 00:52:13.540
We should judge exceptions
strictly but fairly.

00:52:14.710 --> 00:52:18.500
Paganism in its independent and
purely natural state.

00:52:20.260 --> 00:52:21.590
Dreams.

00:52:23.140 --> 00:52:24.430
Absence and corruption.

00:52:27.220 --> 00:52:29.850
We create God for ourselves.

00:52:30.520 --> 00:52:35.650
Those who know him,
serve him wholeheartedly.

00:52:36.520 --> 00:52:41.070
They don't know l am judging them
by my own watch.

00:52:44.570 --> 00:52:45.450
Fear.

00:52:45.910 --> 00:52:47.370
Hatred.

00:52:47.580 --> 00:52:48.990
Submission.

00:52:48.990 --> 00:52:53.710
Those who don't know God,
truly desire Him.

00:52:54.120 --> 00:52:55.080
Probability.

00:52:56.460 --> 00:52:59.130
There are 3 types of people.

00:52:59.920 --> 00:53:03.470
The ones in the middle are
unfortunate and conform to reason.

00:53:04.550 --> 00:53:08.140
The ones at the end are
unfortunate and foolish.

00:53:09.600 --> 00:53:11.600
Bad thoughts are necessary.

00:53:11.600 --> 00:53:15.140
Recognize yourself and
follow your carnal desires.

00:53:16.770 --> 00:53:18.770
There is an Art.

00:53:18.980 --> 00:53:22.530
As long as it is not denied,

00:53:22.530 --> 00:53:27.070
whether it's a principle of
truth or flesh,

00:53:27.280 --> 00:53:30.830
this Art clarifies the relationship
between principles.

00:53:30.830 --> 00:53:35.830
All creatures torture and tempt him.

00:53:35.830 --> 00:53:38.290
And control him through violence,

00:53:38.290 --> 00:53:41.380
or through gentle temptation.

00:53:41.380 --> 00:53:44.800
This latter is more terrifying
and absolute.

00:53:53.560 --> 00:53:54.640
Two extremes.

00:53:55.310 --> 00:53:58.900
Exclusion of reason.
Absolute belief in reason.

00:54:01.980 --> 00:54:03.150
What causes the phenomenon?

00:54:04.150 --> 00:54:08.450
Lust and power are the source
of our intentions.

00:54:09.200 --> 00:54:13.950
Lust is a voluntary intention and
power is an involuntary intention.

00:54:15.410 --> 00:54:19.210
People begin to rebel
against perfection itself.

00:54:19.750 --> 00:54:24.300
If you know your own sins,
you will lose heart.

00:54:24.300 --> 00:54:29.390
Because I believe in you and
the depravity of those sins.

00:54:32.350 --> 00:54:36.480
If you don't want it to end,

00:54:36.730 --> 00:54:40.690
you must make people believe
it is true and eternal.

00:54:40.690 --> 00:54:43.400
You must hide its origin.

00:54:45.650 --> 00:54:48.400
Probability will provide certainty.

00:54:49.820 --> 00:54:54.120
We are automated as well as spiritual.

00:54:56.460 --> 00:54:59.960
Complete your salvation fearfully.

00:55:02.130 --> 00:55:03.880
The epitome of evil.

00:55:04.210 --> 00:55:05.670
An embodiment.

00:55:13.140 --> 00:55:17.220
Man has lost his way.
Fallen from grace.

00:55:17.230 --> 00:55:20.230
Trying to find his place.

00:55:20.230 --> 00:55:24.570
But who will deliver him there?

00:55:27.440 --> 00:55:29.740
A secure foothold.

00:55:30.530 --> 00:55:31.320
God's Grace.

00:55:32.120 --> 00:55:36.160
The strongest and most credible proof
are our habits.

00:55:36.160 --> 00:55:38.580
Habits influence automation

00:55:38.580 --> 00:55:41.210
and automation unwittingly
drags the mind with it.

00:55:41.210 --> 00:55:45.210
You must make them believe,
so this isn't reversed.

00:55:53.050 --> 00:55:55.640
A kind of dubious obscurity.

00:55:55.890 --> 00:55:57.220
Vague ambiguity.

00:55:59.600 --> 00:56:02.980
Nature is an image. Darkness.

00:56:04.110 --> 00:56:09.320
God guides us to the one essential thing
through diversity

00:56:09.320 --> 00:56:11.110
to satisfy both sides.

00:56:11.280 --> 00:56:13.910
"I don't know..." they say.

00:56:14.620 --> 00:56:18.580
What's not perfectly good is just
an embodiment of it.

00:56:23.130 --> 00:56:25.580
The only necessity.

00:56:29.800 --> 00:56:33.590
Exclusion of reason.
Absolute belief in reason.

00:56:33.590 --> 00:56:35.430
Two extremes.

00:56:35.430 --> 00:56:37.850
Without this mediator,

00:56:37.850 --> 00:56:41.270
we will lose all contact with God.

00:56:41.640 --> 00:56:43.140
Protector of God's Grace.

00:56:47.320 --> 00:56:49.530
Language is the same either way.

00:56:49.530 --> 00:56:53.700
Those who pass judgment,
need a focal point.

00:56:53.860 --> 00:56:55.360
The lecture on God's Grace.

00:56:55.660 --> 00:56:58.200
Witnesses who don't excuse death.

00:56:58.620 --> 00:56:59.950
Two witnesses.

00:57:03.170 --> 00:57:04.370
A ladder.

00:57:04.370 --> 00:57:06.000
Two foundations.

00:57:06.000 --> 00:57:09.630
One internal, one external.

00:57:10.090 --> 00:57:15.010
God's Grace and miracles
are both natural phenomena.

00:57:19.560 --> 00:57:22.890
Not only do we see things
from a different perspective,

00:57:23.060 --> 00:57:24.850
we see through different eyes.

00:57:24.850 --> 00:57:28.650
So, why would they appear the same?

00:57:30.030 --> 00:57:32.490
If God supports nature,

00:57:32.650 --> 00:57:35.740
then let nature prove this clearly,

00:57:36.030 --> 00:57:38.200
I often wished.

00:57:39.990 --> 00:57:44.000
The work of God's Grace.
Absence and corruption.

00:57:44.460 --> 00:57:46.250
An embodiment.

00:57:47.130 --> 00:57:51.750
Nature made all these things
mutually exclusive.

00:57:52.420 --> 00:57:54.090
Tyranny.

00:57:54.090 --> 00:57:56.630
A fake window creates balance.

00:57:56.640 --> 00:57:59.760
People only seek horizontal symmetry.

00:57:59.760 --> 00:58:03.680
Not in height or depth.

00:58:06.600 --> 00:58:10.980
If you recognize me,
compare yourself to me.

00:58:11.360 --> 00:58:13.860
What are you comparing?

00:58:14.030 --> 00:58:17.400
Yourself? Or me within you?

00:58:17.410 --> 00:58:21.990
If it is yourself, that is despicable.

00:58:21.990 --> 00:58:25.330
You are comparing me to myself.

00:58:26.160 --> 00:58:30.960
For 4000 years, people continued to

00:58:30.960 --> 00:58:35.050
prophesize about His Coming.

00:58:37.720 --> 00:58:41.390
To desire glory. Greatness.

00:58:46.810 --> 00:58:48.350
Probability.

00:58:48.350 --> 00:58:53.980
But is it probable
that probability provides certainty?

00:58:57.820 --> 00:59:04.160
Truth does not inhabit the earth.
Truth wanders amongst us.

00:59:05.200 --> 00:59:07.500
Those who escape it are fortunate.

00:59:10.710 --> 00:59:14.590
God's Grace is a natural phenomenon.

00:59:19.970 --> 00:59:23.760
To prove that nature is the image of God

00:59:23.760 --> 00:59:25.640
we are perfect in some sense.

00:59:25.640 --> 00:59:30.770
To prove we are only but an image,
we have some faults.

00:59:33.900 --> 00:59:38.440
Reason controls us much more severely.

00:59:39.320 --> 00:59:42.660
Nature has made us extremely neutral.

00:59:42.660 --> 00:59:47.290
We always end up evening the scales.

00:59:51.460 --> 00:59:56.800
God guides us to the one essential thing
through diversity,

00:59:56.960 --> 00:59:59.720
to satisfy both sides.

01:00:02.550 --> 01:00:06.220
Imagine a body full of bodies of thought.

01:00:06.770 --> 01:00:11.980
If it splits,
and doesn't return to the whole,

01:00:11.980 --> 01:00:15.560
it was only meant for death
and destruction.

01:00:19.690 --> 01:00:22.610
Universal good is within us

01:00:22.610 --> 01:00:25.990
It is us, but is not us.

01:00:25.990 --> 01:00:29.450
Because it is infinite.

01:00:29.450 --> 01:00:32.830
A prisoner awaiting his execution.

01:00:33.290 --> 01:00:34.540
Contradiction.

01:00:34.750 --> 01:00:36.880
It belittles us.

01:00:37.380 --> 01:00:39.550
It hates us.

01:00:39.880 --> 01:00:45.050
If two things unite without changing,
one will not become the other.

01:00:45.220 --> 01:00:47.220
Thus, our spirit unites with our bodies

01:00:47.390 --> 01:00:50.390
and maintains a balance
of opposing vices.

01:00:58.820 --> 01:01:01.690
Our souls are thrown into a body

01:01:01.700 --> 01:01:06.410
and find numbers, time, a third dimension.
It makes inferences,

01:01:06.410 --> 01:01:10.870
and calls it nature, inevitability.
We cannot think of anything else.

01:01:11.160 --> 01:01:15.710
We recognize truth not just
through reason, but through emotion.

01:01:15.710 --> 01:01:19.000
Emotion senses that space
has a third dimension.

01:01:19.000 --> 01:01:21.800
It senses principle,
and a proposition is made.

01:01:21.800 --> 01:01:24.380
Emotion, instinct, principle.

01:01:24.380 --> 01:01:27.010
Instinct and reason.
Two natural symbols.

01:01:27.510 --> 01:01:31.770
God's Grace will always exist,
as will nature.

01:01:31.770 --> 01:01:35.100
Therefore, God's Grace is natural,
in a sense.

01:01:35.100 --> 01:01:39.440
Birth symbolizing the creation of Man.

01:01:39.690 --> 01:01:43.570
Baptism symbolizing the Atonement.

01:01:44.030 --> 01:01:46.780
He came to this earth
to impart truth without symbolism.

01:01:46.780 --> 01:01:51.450
But to say he only came symbolically
and to refute his existence

01:01:51.450 --> 01:01:53.290
is a blasphemy.

01:01:57.630 --> 01:01:59.960
Love is not a symbolic rule.

01:02:21.520 --> 01:02:25.320
By systematically explaining
the origin of love,

01:02:25.320 --> 01:02:28.740
one cannot confirm
that he should be loved.

01:02:28.740 --> 01:02:30.990
One must sympathize with both sides.

01:02:30.990 --> 01:02:35.000
But while one is sympathy born of love,

01:02:35.000 --> 01:02:38.460
the other is sympathy born of contempt.

01:02:39.330 --> 01:02:40.670
The various origins of love.

01:02:40.840 --> 01:02:42.710
Protector of God's Grace.

01:02:42.710 --> 01:02:43.460
Contradiction.

01:02:43.760 --> 01:02:47.300
Unspoken desire.
Deception. Salvation.

01:02:47.470 --> 01:02:49.220
The only necessity.

01:02:50.220 --> 01:02:51.550
Dream.

01:02:52.010 --> 01:02:54.720
The difference between
rest and ease of conscience.

01:02:55.100 --> 01:02:58.980
Nothing besides the truth is certain.

01:02:59.940 --> 01:03:05.190
The first birth creates the former.
The Grace of the second creates the latter.

01:03:05.190 --> 01:03:08.200
l can love complete darkness

01:03:08.530 --> 01:03:11.870
but if God thinks me unlucky,

01:03:12.160 --> 01:03:15.290
that haphazardness will anger me.

01:03:15.290 --> 01:03:19.250
l don't accept its merits.
Not like complete darkness.

01:03:19.250 --> 01:03:20.540
So it makes me angry.

01:03:20.540 --> 01:03:26.380
This is proof that l idolize darkness
and have drifted far from God's Order.

01:03:26.380 --> 01:03:30.220
l don't know who l am
and what I should do.

01:03:30.220 --> 01:03:34.180
l don't know my state of being
or my responsibility.

01:03:34.180 --> 01:03:39.600
My heart wants to search
for and serve God.

01:03:39.600 --> 01:03:41.560
l will sacrifice everything to find it.

01:03:41.560 --> 01:03:46.150
No price is too high for immortality.

01:03:46.400 --> 01:03:49.450
A God that conducts all
with benevolent will.

01:03:49.450 --> 01:03:51.410
His power and intimidation.

01:03:51.410 --> 01:03:53.070
Tyranny.

01:04:06.500 --> 01:04:08.460
He, who is worthy of atonement.

01:04:08.470 --> 01:04:10.170
Of receiving it.

01:04:10.180 --> 01:04:11.840
Infinity, large and small.

01:04:11.840 --> 01:04:13.180
Order of a limited perfection

01:04:13.180 --> 01:04:15.010
created for the sake of infinity.

01:04:16.140 --> 01:04:20.480
When all those teachings are
contained in one,

01:04:20.730 --> 01:04:24.690
as if hidden inside a box,

01:04:24.940 --> 01:04:29.320
they will appear, essentially chaotic.

01:04:33.780 --> 01:04:36.700
It is not true that everything
manifests God.

01:04:36.910 --> 01:04:39.700
Nor that God is hidden from us.

01:04:39.700 --> 01:04:44.040
But God hides himself
from those who test him,

01:04:44.040 --> 01:04:49.170
and reveals himself
to those who believe.

01:04:49.760 --> 01:04:54.760
Inside this gigantic prison,
there is no direction.

01:04:56.140 --> 01:04:57.970
In the hands of an angry God.

01:04:57.970 --> 01:04:58.720
Time.

01:04:59.310 --> 01:05:02.980
Once an immortal being exists,
he always exists.

01:05:03.350 --> 01:05:07.690
We want to live an imaginary life
within another's mind.

01:05:08.480 --> 01:05:12.190
God is infinite, first of all.

01:05:12.200 --> 01:05:13.700
Empty Space.

01:05:14.410 --> 01:05:19.700
That cannot be changed by will.
It is power and intimidation.

01:05:20.500 --> 01:05:22.370
Tyranny.

01:05:23.960 --> 01:05:26.330
The be all and end all.

01:05:27.590 --> 01:05:30.340
A mutual and inescapable relationship.

01:05:31.710 --> 01:05:33.090
Error and falsehood.

01:05:33.090 --> 01:05:34.170
The Protector of truth.

01:05:34.340 --> 01:05:35.880
Another form of insanity.

01:05:36.340 --> 01:05:38.100
Hateful things.

01:05:38.100 --> 01:05:39.470
Fear.

01:05:40.010 --> 01:05:41.720
God's deeds.
Salivation.

01:05:41.930 --> 01:05:45.480
Infinite chaos separates us.

01:05:45.480 --> 01:05:48.980
And somewhere in that infinity,
a bet is being wagered.

01:05:48.980 --> 01:05:51.690
Will it be a crucifix,
or will it not?

01:05:54.400 --> 01:05:57.660
Our souls are thrown into a body

01:05:58.030 --> 01:06:02.700
and find numbers, time,
a third dimension.

01:06:03.040 --> 01:06:05.210
Activity at a standstill.

01:06:05.460 --> 01:06:07.370
Countless infinity.

01:06:07.630 --> 01:06:09.630
Ambiguous and limitless.

01:06:10.170 --> 01:06:15.050
Our nature is in activity.
Total stillness means death.

01:06:15.550 --> 01:06:16.720
A void.
Order.

01:06:16.720 --> 01:06:21.310
Nature placed the
entirety of truth inside themselves.

01:06:22.810 --> 01:06:27.600
Our intentions entrap our souls
in another's.

01:06:27.940 --> 01:06:31.110
We each have our own place.

01:06:33.150 --> 01:06:38.450
Our imagination makes
small things big enough to fulfill us

01:06:38.450 --> 01:06:42.530
and makes big things small
so that they are more like us.

01:06:43.950 --> 01:06:46.910
We make ourselves
for our own God.

01:06:47.750 --> 01:06:49.960
Adam's glory.

01:06:50.500 --> 01:06:54.340
The spark of fire.
Finding a focal point.

01:06:55.380 --> 01:06:56.920
The circle of life.

01:06:58.050 --> 01:07:00.590
The neverending reversal
from right to wrong.

01:07:00.930 --> 01:07:03.390
Amazing geometry.

01:07:03.640 --> 01:07:07.730
Infinite numbers.
A limited, yet infinite space.

01:07:08.190 --> 01:07:11.980
Numbers duplicate space.

01:07:12.270 --> 01:07:15.030
Nature diversifies and duplicates.

01:07:15.030 --> 01:07:17.110
Artificiality duplicates and diversifies.

01:07:17.110 --> 01:07:21.160
All unresolved matters still exist.

01:07:21.820 --> 01:07:23.280
His Words...

01:07:23.280 --> 01:07:25.490
The God within God...

01:07:25.500 --> 01:07:31.210
He gave life to all
through His own rebirth.

01:07:31.790 --> 01:07:34.250
Emptiness. Power.

01:07:34.420 --> 01:07:35.880
A focal point.
A void.

01:07:36.420 --> 01:07:40.720
That which is not essential.
Extremely wrong...

01:07:40.720 --> 01:07:43.800
But in order to maintain His supremacy,

01:07:43.810 --> 01:07:46.970
God granted prayer to His believers.

01:07:48.020 --> 01:07:50.390
A wish for dependent independence.

01:07:50.600 --> 01:07:52.060
Insufficiency.
Prayer.

01:07:52.060 --> 01:07:54.150
Everything is duality.

01:07:54.150 --> 01:07:57.820
Everyone is both alive and dead.

01:07:57.820 --> 01:08:03.570
The chosen and abandoned always exist
in the marvelous order.

01:08:03.570 --> 01:08:05.490
The root of self-love.

01:08:05.490 --> 01:08:07.330
The hateful thing.

01:08:07.330 --> 01:08:09.080
Me.

01:08:22.550 --> 01:08:24.220
HAPPY MACHlNE

01:23:11.520 --> 01:23:13.980
To be continued...

01:23:45.680 --> 01:23:48.980
Music Room

01:24:12.710 --> 01:24:13.500
Hazuki.

01:24:14.130 --> 01:24:15.800
Who, me?

01:24:16.090 --> 01:24:17.000
Yeah.

01:24:17.760 --> 01:24:18.760
Uh...

01:24:19.590 --> 01:24:24.930
Just for today, let's forget about
tomorrow or the future,

01:24:25.430 --> 01:24:26.600
and go somewhere...

01:24:26.600 --> 01:24:28.020
Shall we?

01:24:28.230 --> 01:24:30.270
What's with the "shall we?"

01:24:30.480 --> 01:24:31.600
Let's go.

01:24:32.060 --> 01:24:33.770
You mean... cut class?

01:24:34.270 --> 01:24:36.400
You could put it that way.

01:24:38.280 --> 01:24:40.490
l wouldn't mind.

01:24:46.120 --> 01:24:50.370
Let's blow all our money
and go as far as it'll take us.

01:24:50.370 --> 01:24:51.620
Where to?

01:24:51.620 --> 01:24:54.380
Let's see... South of the border?

01:24:55.960 --> 01:24:56.710
Where then?

01:24:57.250 --> 01:25:00.630
I've never been to Shonan Beach before.

01:25:01.260 --> 01:25:02.590
Me either.

01:25:02.590 --> 01:25:04.590
l want to do fireworks on the beach.

01:25:06.470 --> 01:25:07.640
Well?

01:25:07.810 --> 01:25:08.640
Fine.

01:25:09.270 --> 01:25:13.190
But it's so unlike you.
To cut class and all.

01:25:13.190 --> 01:25:13.980
Really?

01:25:13.980 --> 01:25:17.480
I always thought you were a "good boy."

01:25:17.480 --> 01:25:18.770
Why?

01:25:18.780 --> 01:25:21.740
Because you're so smart.

01:25:22.030 --> 01:25:25.450
l was always in awe of you.

01:25:25.450 --> 01:25:26.990
lt's just a pain.

01:25:28.620 --> 01:25:33.370
To have to listen to parents and
teachers go on and on about grades.

01:25:33.370 --> 01:25:36.420
I hate being told what to do.

01:25:37.790 --> 01:25:40.630
But it is my first time cutting class.

01:25:40.840 --> 01:25:43.260
So you're a "good boy" after all.

01:25:43.630 --> 01:25:46.760
How about you? Do you cut classes?

01:25:47.970 --> 01:25:49.970
Sometimes.

01:25:49.970 --> 01:25:51.430
You delinquent, you.

01:25:51.430 --> 01:25:53.020
Shut up!

01:25:56.690 --> 01:26:02.360
lt's been a long time
since we've talked like this.

01:26:15.670 --> 01:26:16.790
Here.

01:26:17.670 --> 01:26:19.710
Thanks!

01:26:30.060 --> 01:26:35.020
Do you remember
our childhood secret?

01:26:49.950 --> 01:26:52.200
What did you do with it?

01:26:52.370 --> 01:26:55.200
I tried to use it once.

01:26:55.210 --> 01:26:56.120
Really?!

01:26:56.120 --> 01:26:59.750
There was this teacher from hell
in middle school.

01:27:00.210 --> 01:27:03.250
You went to an all girls school,
so you wouldn't know.

01:27:03.260 --> 01:27:05.670
He was all violent.

01:27:06.050 --> 01:27:06.800
Yeah?

01:27:06.800 --> 01:27:11.260
l thought about
bombing the teacher's lounge.

01:27:12.220 --> 01:27:14.640
You're shocked?

01:27:14.890 --> 01:27:16.640
No.

01:27:18.100 --> 01:27:21.060
I'm glad I didn't go through with it.

01:27:21.650 --> 01:27:24.110
That's good.

01:27:24.570 --> 01:27:26.990
l brought it today, Actually.

01:27:27.570 --> 01:27:28.780
No way.

01:27:29.240 --> 01:27:32.780
You and l are the only ones
who know about it.

01:27:33.790 --> 01:27:35.410
Let's bury it together.

01:27:35.410 --> 01:27:36.410
OK.

01:27:36.620 --> 01:27:38.000
You know...

01:27:38.000 --> 01:27:38.960
What?

01:27:39.580 --> 01:27:42.540
You're not a "good boy" after all.

01:27:50.760 --> 01:27:51.800
Which way?

01:27:51.800 --> 01:27:54.470
Probably this way.

01:28:04.570 --> 01:28:06.780
Let's see...

01:28:06.780 --> 01:28:10.780
Let's just follow that beach bum.

01:28:38.810 --> 01:28:43.850
Hakone. The terminal, Hakone.

01:28:45.190 --> 01:28:46.360
Crap!

01:28:46.520 --> 01:28:47.190
What?

01:28:47.860 --> 01:28:50.150
Where the heck are we?

01:28:50.150 --> 01:28:52.070
Did we miss it?

01:28:57.830 --> 01:29:00.580
All train lines are now closed.

01:29:00.790 --> 01:29:03.170
Damn! l hate the suburbs.

01:29:03.170 --> 01:29:06.500
What will we do?
l have only 1000 yen.

01:29:06.500 --> 01:29:11.170
We'll have to steal a motorbike
and ride off into the sunset...

01:29:11.380 --> 01:29:15.510
But the best we could do was...

01:29:15.930 --> 01:29:17.180
You OK?

01:29:17.430 --> 01:29:19.810
Well, we're not there yet...

01:29:20.770 --> 01:29:25.400
You there, riding double
without headlights. Stop!

01:29:25.690 --> 01:29:28.230
Oh no, it's a cop.

01:29:28.400 --> 01:29:29.440
- Go!
- What?!

01:29:29.440 --> 01:29:30.280
Hey you!

01:29:38.280 --> 01:29:39.540
He's so fast!

01:29:43.710 --> 01:29:44.540
Don't underestimate me!

01:30:14.400 --> 01:30:16.950
Hey! Not that way!

01:30:17.160 --> 01:30:18.370
To the expressway

01:31:13.710 --> 01:31:17.380
Where do you punks think you are?

01:31:18.800 --> 01:31:20.340
What era is he from?

01:31:21.180 --> 01:31:24.970
Are you listening?

01:31:25.850 --> 01:31:28.980
Hey, the girl's hot.

01:31:28.980 --> 01:31:33.820
Leave her and I'll let you go.

01:31:35.690 --> 01:31:39.030
We're not thinking about tomorrow

01:31:39.030 --> 01:31:41.700
or the future for that matter.

01:31:41.700 --> 01:31:42.870
What?

01:31:42.870 --> 01:31:44.540
In other words,

01:31:45.330 --> 01:31:46.870
l don't give a shit!

01:31:47.080 --> 01:31:48.910
What the hell is that?

01:31:48.920 --> 01:31:50.920
Whoa! Chill out, man!

01:32:37.710 --> 01:32:39.420
The fireworks.

01:32:39.880 --> 01:32:42.050
It's light out already.

01:32:42.050 --> 01:32:44.720
That's OK. Let's do it anyways.

01:32:44.720 --> 01:32:47.350
But we don't even have a lighter.

01:32:49.270 --> 01:32:51.100
l could rub two sticks together.

01:32:55.940 --> 01:32:57.860
...maybe not.

01:33:09.910 --> 01:33:13.920
Why did you ask me to come with you?

01:33:16.000 --> 01:33:18.550
I'm moving tomorrow.

01:33:18.760 --> 01:33:19.960
To Shinshu.

01:33:19.960 --> 01:33:21.300
What?

01:33:23.470 --> 01:33:28.010
Everyone will forget about me.
Out of sight, out of mind.

01:33:28.930 --> 01:33:34.390
l mean, l don't remember anyone
that's moved away...

01:33:36.480 --> 01:33:38.770
l know that's how it is, but...

01:33:39.320 --> 01:33:43.490
I had the sudden urge
to go somewhere with you.

01:33:47.830 --> 01:33:49.330
l wish...

01:33:50.540 --> 01:33:53.710
We could just disappear somewhere.

01:34:02.720 --> 01:34:04.010
I...

01:34:04.180 --> 01:34:09.010
always looked up to you when
we were little.

01:34:09.810 --> 01:34:11.930
I had a crush on you.

01:34:13.890 --> 01:34:16.520
But now...

01:34:17.650 --> 01:34:19.820
l know... you have a boyfriend.

01:34:21.030 --> 01:34:22.480
How'd you know?

01:34:23.530 --> 01:34:25.700
I see you guys walking together.

01:34:27.370 --> 01:34:28.490
Yeah.

01:34:30.200 --> 01:34:31.740
I know...

01:34:36.870 --> 01:34:38.210
Let's go back.

01:34:40.630 --> 01:34:44.300
There's nowhere to go.

01:35:01.190 --> 01:35:02.860
When are you leaving?

01:35:04.240 --> 01:35:08.240
Tonight at 7.
But don't see me off or anything.

01:35:11.780 --> 01:35:13.910
That would only make it harder.

01:35:38.900 --> 01:35:43.520
See ya!

01:35:52.990 --> 01:35:55.330
What is it, Sho?

01:35:55.330 --> 01:35:57.540
Nothing.

01:37:57.950 --> 01:38:00.950
GENIUS PARTY

01:38:02.000 --> 01:38:05.960
Directed by Atsuko Fukushima

